<!-- Maps › Configuration (plans/archive/Maps.md §3.1, §4.2; docs/tools/Maps.md): the installation's map providers, profiles and
    layers, the outside-request policy and readiness (Settings, with a provider's page in ConnectionDetail), and the Geo
    data sets and their imports (GeoData). MAPS_ADMIN (data/MapsSecurityData.xml): ADMIN's, and denied to MAPS_USERS. The
    always-actions ask for the caller's own grant of this screen (isPermittedOwn), which every render and transition below
    runs: an allow of Maps.xml that some app grants its own group is inheritable and would otherwise reach Configuration
    and the services its transitions call, so it confers nothing here, and an app that shows Configuration under its own
    root has its administrators hold MAPS_ADMIN themselves (Maps.xml hides the tab from everyone else). Its route key is
    mapsConfiguration (template/AdminMount.js), and the settings index names it (SettingsEntry maps.configuration). -->
<screen xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="http://moqui.org/xsd/mr-xml-screen.xsd"
        default-menu-title="Configuration" default-menu-index="9" menu-image="sym_o_settings" menu-image-type="icon">
    <always-actions>
        <script><![CDATA[
            if (!ec.artifactExecution.isPermittedOwn('component://tools/screen/Maps/Configuration.xml', 'AT_XML_SCREEN', 'view')) {
                // worded and marked as the framework's own refusal of an artifact (403 in a request)
                const refusal = new Error('User ' + (ec.user.userId || '[No User]') + ' is not authorized for AT_XML_SCREEN'
                    + ' [component://tools/screen/Maps/Configuration.xml] action view: Maps configuration needs the user\'s own MAPS_ADMIN grant')
                refusal.moquiErrorKind = 'Unauthorized'
                throw refusal
            }
        ]]></script>
    </always-actions>
    <subscreens default-item="Settings"/>
    <widgets>
        <subscreens-panel id="MapsConfigurationPanel" type="tab"/>
    </widgets>
</screen>
